msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_DA7B9844_485E_4F03_85FC_0841A86EE882"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Yeah, I was hoping to increase our selection of vegetables!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫And while I’m at "
"it, if possible..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oui, je pensais augmenter notre choix de légumes !⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Et pendant que j’y suis, si "
"possible..."

#: scenario5:scenario5_B68B0FD0_B3AD_4D48_86F5_59EA81E69C88
