msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫My relationship with Michel "
"gradually transitioned from master and servant to something closer to friends."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Ma relation avec Michel, de "
"maître et servante qu’elle était, se transforma peu à peu en quelque chose qui ressemblait "
"davantage à de l’amitié."

#: scenario5:scenario5_C80E822B_FA8A_4411_821A_E295F40BFF1E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c4987a4d81b1806ef3c5e1df11f95deeb97530875be05502d1f221a990ec6237
#. default-sha256: 34f5e6434df43de79e2007643ccad5889a550c95965871b4156ce55efc943d76
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C80E822B_FA8A_4411_821A_E295F40BFF1E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He was still my master, but he allowed me almost complete freedom,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Il était toujours mon maître mais il m’accordait une liberté presque complète,"

#: scenario5:scenario5_1DC9B6EA_6289_4FA4_8355_19D0E652CBBE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: deacab9f0c6741c3314715491e1344d78536913766f0b9e7e64fa952d478f4b5
#. default-sha256: a0d65689ee9a8d15425b0931c2f7b09c18e5a16e93c68d0228634c8b9392097f
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_1DC9B6EA_6289_4FA4_8355_19D0E652CBBE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and he didn’t order me around either.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫He even gave me a hand with my work."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫et il ne me donnait pas d’ordres.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Il m’offrait même un coup de main pour le travail."

#: scenario5:scenario5_A87FD8DF_8DC5_4511_92C2_070132823A3B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a3161c14bcf6171a650a617aec68a52ce1c74aa458c5126870703b97aa370e27
#. default-sha256: cca3fa176cce49ace2993a23656492ac4e6a3c667f2d68fad5566f7056f6c452
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A87FD8DF_8DC5_4511_92C2_070132823A3B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Though he was still not very talkative and oftentimes hard to read,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il n’était toujours pas des plus bavards et j’avais parfois du mal à savoir ce qu’il pensait,"

#: scenario5:scenario5_2741137E_28E2_442A_BC1B_98B1B92244DA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 35b69ac5314d15246bd7ab38243edaafec7f8bc8629b2927751867f7e7b6ded1
#. default-sha256: e6fe4a02f1caf605974f752ed679004e8ac8af064a83e6a7a6f793953831afe6
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_2741137E_28E2_442A_BC1B_98B1B92244DA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫he at least seemed to be making an effort to close the gap."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫mais au moins il semblait faire des efforts pour réduire la distance."

#: scenario5:scenario5_6D3547AE_EDF0_4132_9288_C3FBD619F14A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5852d4140f6aae164c1bfa0052621e5bef5d6ec9fda28dbb4a31d37290d66d71
#. default-sha256: 7f91ba855ce8fde9712fff03ae3121da50b296dc2f199b01987461a4a3f75c97
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_6D3547AE_EDF0_4132_9288_C3FBD619F14A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He would, on occasion, tell me about himself—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫though not in much detail, and "
"anytime his family came up, he grimaced uncomfortably."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫De temps en temps, il me parlait de lui—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ sans jamais entrer dans les détails, "
"toutefois, et à chaque fois qu’on abordait sa famille, il grimaçait, mal à l’aise."

#: scenario5:scenario5_5D9B438E_9E68_4E35_8F6C_2E778FC3251C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3913df7a161faa448555659155514fc9d232bcb55a3672097bf9c58a0f7a72ee
#. default-sha256: 4c6c12fd86b5fecd66b77d49091ed923700f60ed8529f80f7627fd0e4226a734
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_5D9B438E_9E68_4E35_8F6C_2E778FC3251C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Apparently, his father had wanted him dead."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Apparemment, son père le voulait mort."

#: scenario5:scenario5_19301F89_0C4E_4A94_B2F9_74ACE8871DE9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4b9ba828364ac87ffd0607fe8bfe5b98245eeb0f5a3c827dfc3c2c970324b6f7
#. default-sha256: 860dd536babc6959d306dd9357fd02c8b9344dc904efce5fff587beca49e8abb
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_19301F89_0C4E_4A94_B2F9_74ACE8871DE9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫His brothers, though, had worked to create a scenario in which he could live, faking his "
"death and sending him to this remote mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫C’étaient ses frères qui s’étaient efforcés d’imaginer un cas de figure dans lequel il "
"pourrait vivre, en simulant sa mort et en l’envoyant dans ce manoir reculé."

#: scenario5:scenario5_5A68A665_39D6_4D33_9CFE_07F9D54E4349
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 83be4184dd8e1325c05a0a9b091a948340f92209791fa0105bdcccc5795a7bd5
#. default-sha256: 7017f472d0894fd94ce6012491e791f35da95460050eca4df409e0a1dbfe9249
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_5A68A665_39D6_4D33_9CFE_07F9D54E4349"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I had never encountered Michel’s brothers while at his family’s estate."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Je n’avais jamais rencontré les frères de Michel quand j’étais dans sa famille."

#: scenario5:scenario5_F237594D_9E48_4DC3_98F6_FB45C98AB6BE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8bca583cd382f541ce76306be2f94e0fdbffc29f7597d3fd186158f6848b0135
#. default-sha256: f6642c361d5f399149856695db37daf20c7759e61ddf9c5aa8f2f7082479b6ec
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F237594D_9E48_4DC3_98F6_FB45C98AB6BE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But assuming he was right and it was one of them who had given me that letter, they were "
"likely our only allies at that house."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais à supposer qu’il avait raison et que c’était l’un d’entre eux qui m’avait donné cette "
"lettre, ils étaient probablement nos seuls alliés dans cette maison."

#: scenario5:scenario5_913D6AFA_9829_4FAB_925E_2C845ED7201F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e04f1d753bc5ec19e2cf53c88f29f44551e68bbf4a5149e98ac988d9315c7918
#. default-sha256: 70edf63e080a4065ea21fa49e6a672d22d7dfe9444c9ae5bf683d6175af7916c
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_913D6AFA_9829_4FAB_925E_2C845ED7201F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“I don’t know what he’s thinking. It’s been ten years,”⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Michel had muttered, ⟪k:3⟫"
"to which I had replied, ⟪k:4⟫“Have faith.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫« Je ne sais pas à quoi il pense. Cela fait dix ans. »,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫avait murmuré Michel, ⟪k:3⟫"
"ce à quoi je répondis ⟪k:4⟫« Gardez espoir »."

#: scenario5:scenario5_FD24F619_1B8D_4FFC_BE52_2FCD51455CC9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e37f6ef802e5174b1c4f6cfef5a5f07b641c6750f42515c62e657ebef3b7ce9b
#. default-sha256: 85c46a275fb5dc6ffbd1ddceda07aa74c09d83b98b919bb72ab50af89dc74248
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_FD24F619_1B8D_4FFC_BE52_2FCD51455CC9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was better to believe in ⟪k:1⟫something⟪k:2⟫,⟪k:3⟫even if it felt silly and unreasonable,"
"⟪k:4⟫than to lose faith in everything."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il valait mieux croire en ⟪k:1⟫quelque chose⟪k:2⟫, même si ça semblait idiot et absurde, que "
"de perdre espoir en tout."

#: scenario5:scenario5_0D065B95_6ECA_4733_AA0D_848FE1AA8859
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 12904148f5d124f961a1fab21e0b4ebf516d6f5f3440bd3825275197cc4fe8e8
#. default-sha256: 67debc5389a496a555a697413bb40a63db2918d12367fbaca0b80067f5b02855
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_0D065B95_6ECA_4733_AA0D_848FE1AA8859"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My being able to find renewed belief in the kindness of people...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫was what had "
"allowed me to start smiling again, after all."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Si j’avais réussi à retrouver le sourire, après tout...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫...c’était bien parce que "
"je n’avais cessé de croire en la bonté des gens."

#: scenario5:scenario5_15ECF28D_FA37_4808_8C6E_9115AEA4A2E0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0353b88ffd501f0bee94681ddccf8c8fbec5b7c8f38a0a4f022c41110960442e
#. default-sha256: bd8c14263cf26025d350492fdb9f3d7a65be7d10fe74f1b7d3ee3bec584f87c1
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_15ECF28D_FA37_4808_8C6E_9115AEA4A2E0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Because I was able to have that faith, I was able to enjoy life once more."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Parce que je réussissais à garder cette foi, j’arrivais encore à profiter de la vie."

#: scenario5:scenario5_4DB14F68_C71B_41DB_929A_EA8255CB3FB0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1b9b697c6f5b0fb1b6f48c554092bf61828ad4b5ed9aba1ed22a284e086e7493
#. default-sha256: 7a75a7dced91baea3795a63a6a5ddfe1557621232d50b7fd7f6911ac35f44ec1
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_4DB14F68_C71B_41DB_929A_EA8255CB3FB0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It wasn’t an exciting or thrilling life; ⟪k:1⟫it was a humble, simple one with just the two "
"of us."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ce n’était pas une vie excitante ou trépidante ; ⟪k:1⟫c’était une vie modeste, simple, où on "
"était seulement tous les deux."

#: scenario5:scenario5_84D5B7A5_D528_4F22_A744_3B58EC9C6ECA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4eb282e61d48ce42323cee96792a99b1f9e495b53d94331a21c2d1890f292621
#. default-sha256: 45d6efc7c7121d0d6cbc38a9e07b5ae672aad2646ac3c62d5b924b3651e48775
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_84D5B7A5_D528_4F22_A744_3B58EC9C6ECA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But I wouldn’t trade that light for anything."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Mais je n’aurais échangé cette lumière pour rien au monde."

#: scenario5:scenario5_1CFD07EA_A58A_4A44_993F_45497DCEADC8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 800ad3dacaa0ebaeb480bbe439cb2101fbecf1bfca483ad273e8464f2f3a1aa4
#. default-sha256: e0fc321f61fb2cb1b0a068ad45d6b0c40bbe157443e858aa97bf1df5b05870bc
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_1CFD07EA_A58A_4A44_993F_45497DCEADC8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Some people might think it dull or dreary, but it was ⟪k:1⟫ours⟪k:2⟫."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Certaines personnes pourraient penser que c’était ennuyeux voire assommant mais c’était à "
"⟪k:1⟫nous⟪k:2⟫."

#: scenario5:scenario5_277A3155_8D53_4201_BB00_68B1C0E14DCC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1b3fa3679e7f8dce349ebc9eb65e994bcd5167a5ee0ff9c5b2046aedb13e72cb
#. default-sha256: c0e2a39948717f98170371f94fe19b43bb261ca666b2f76df6891f9e96c0b49e
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_277A3155_8D53_4201_BB00_68B1C0E14DCC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫...Master, I really, truly appreciate that you want to help with the "
"cooking. I do, honestly, but..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫...Maître, je vous suis vraiment, sincèrement reconnaissante de vouloir "
