#. default-sha256: ab91cb537e0e23c2e3bf8889b63da766d455b103df7744b6ee38966b4cc44f0e
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_B93F8ECB_4FBE_4DE7_A74F_0AE23F60E4C3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If I had to describe it, I would say “good friends” was probably the most apt. ⟪k:1⟫Time "
"continued to press on, our relationship remaining relatively stable."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Si j’avais à le décrire, je dirais que l’expression « de bons amis » convenait tout à fait. "
"⟪k:1⟫Le temps suivait son cours et notre relation restait relativement stable."

#: scenario5:scenario5_456F1BD3_2A33_48B2_8B6B_DA8C337576F1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3382bdef195793d44d326789b6b8892faec02747e5dcdc51ea9f17a0da6eb8fb
#. default-sha256: 312b757c4c57982154905c0bd640642e90f2fb5f1fa53d4a94f2b55e515c72b1
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_456F1BD3_2A33_48B2_8B6B_DA8C337576F1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eventually, summer came, bringing with it the longest periods of sunlight I had experienced "
"in many years. ⟪k:1⟫Then, the leaves began falling from the trees, and before long, the world "
"grew cold and dreary."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Bientôt, l’été arriva et avec lui s’installèrent les plus longues périodes d’ensoleillement "
"que j’ai connues depuis très longtemps. ⟪k:1⟫Puis, les feuilles commencèrent à tomber des arbres, "
"et en peu de temps, le monde devint froid et sinistre."

#: scenario5:scenario5_D3609512_D91D_4932_8F85_593F0102A1AF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bb6759975f8d754dfa10e1bb07552da1915bfedee17ad69497e6be353069615e
#. default-sha256: 93df62fb93ca677a611df275188e7a6ee727f2fb351036a8edb7dd6477ff341a
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_D3609512_D91D_4932_8F85_593F0102A1AF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫That winter, the fireplace was never without a crackling blaze in its belly. ⟪k:1⟫The boiled "
"wine we drank was undoubtedly middling and cheap,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Cet hiver-là, la cheminée brûla sans relâche d’un feu crépitant. ⟪k:1⟫Le vin chaud que nous "
"buvions était sans conteste très médiocre,"

#: scenario5:scenario5_3E33F8FD_DBFD_4A8F_897B_7C6E3336E250
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 500762bd6ac0820db901b8b3c606325c2a96681d447ea0d5a788aa65f0e8165b
#. default-sha256: 15bb4ecffba949e4c3ebd5278bb3556eccc950778071775e45ccc5250b8faf07
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_3E33F8FD_DBFD_4A8F_897B_7C6E3336E250"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫but she said, with a smile, ⟪k:1⟫“I’ve never had wine this good before.”⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫And though "
"I didn’t say anything, I felt the same way."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫pourtant elle dit en souriant ⟪k:1⟫« Je n’ai jamais bu de vin aussi bon ».⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Et même "
"si je n’ai rien répondu, je pensais la même chose."

#: scenario5:scenario5_F41DBBF2_2AA4_4DC4_9DD7_D9310B3D9D50
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 04813eff7fc50961c263fc899d61fcd893d39d75e0c51805481b7d4493e20fa4
